# cabin_lit_spill: the windows' warm light falling on the deck at night
# (spec 5.6 item 3): spill (28, brick that ignores the night) in a checker
# on the first board and its shadow under the bank, a sparser checker25 on
# the next board, the deck's ink seam between them left dark, the rim board
# unlit. Placed at at_spill_l, and flipped at at_spill_r (the pattern lands
# on the same grid either way). The anchor, 0,0, is the bank's left foot on
# the deck.
C 28  L 2,0  L 4,0  L 6,0  L 8,0  L 10,0  L 12,0
      L 14,0  L 16,0  L 18,0  L 20,0  L 22,0  L 26,0
      L 1,1  L 5,1  L 9,1  L 13,1  L 17,1  L 21,1
      L 25,1  L 3,3  L 7,3  L 11,3  L 8,4
